<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Holy Grasp</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Paladin (guild level 120)
Mana: 25
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast holy grasp &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast holy grasp</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>A stronger prayer than holy touch: the paladin speaks the liturgy of the 
gods and grasps the target, and those who lean to evil are hurt badly. Any 
target whose alignment is below neutral can be struck, and the truly evil 
are hurt more; on the good and the neutral, nothing happens. The better 
your divine power and sphere, the more it hurts. It does a little better 
against light armour than against heavier armour, and a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on scrolls. 
The strongest of these prayers is holy shout.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
